# The loop writes 0° to 180° and back, 1° every 15 ms, and starts over. The shaft starts at
# its 90° centre, is near the 0° end by 200 ms, then follows the writes at about 68 deg/s.
# write(0) is 544 us, just inside the 500 us stop, so the low end is a few degrees off 0°.
# A run shows 67.7° at 1 s, 178.0° at 2.7 s, 98.0° at 4 s, 6.2° at 5.5 s and 103.7° at 7 s.
open
step 1000ms
expect @servo.angle > 60deg
expect @servo.angle < 75deg
step 1700ms
expect @servo.angle > 170deg
step 1300ms
expect @servo.angle > 90deg
expect @servo.angle < 105deg
step 1500ms
expect @servo.angle < 15deg
step 1500ms
expect @servo.angle > 95deg
expect @servo.angle < 112deg
expect no diagnostics
